# Clean Git & PR Hygiene

Never include tool-specific branding (e.g. Cursor, AI assistant, IDE artifacts) in git history, commit messages, branch names, or PR text.

## Rules
- Use Conventional Commits with ACT-DP Task IDs: `feat(wire): add webhook dispatcher [WIRE-002]`.
- Feature branches: `feature/<scope>-<slug>` (e.g., `feature/wire-feed-api`).
- Keep diffs focused exclusively on the product deliverables.
